      "chunk_text": "Kunal Mehta called insurance agent Anita Sharma to confirm that he will submit the signed declaration form and property valuation report as a single PDF tomorrow morning. They discussed formatting requirements for the valuation report, and Anita agreed to email the bank transfer account details for the $850 premium along with a document checklist. Anita also confirmed that the policy status will change from Pending to Active once the documents are verified.",
